{
  "about": "How a text's @mentions are read, on the server (parseMentions in main.go, TestMentions) and on the page (mentionsIn in web/links.js, node test/mentions.js). own: this server's host, when it has one. local: the members here a text mentions, in lower case, in order, repeats kept. remote: the handles of other servers, name@host as written. Anything shaped @name@... is never a member here: with a host that is not an ASCII DNS name it is plain text, whole (docs/federation.md, finding 9).",
  "cases": [
